OL,3,AHuge crowds greet Pope in Paris for
OL,4,Aopen-air Mass
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than half a million people are
OL,7,Fexpected to attend the event in the
OL,8,Fheart of the French capital on Saturday
OL,9,Fand a special altar has been built on
OL,10,Fthe Place de la Concorde for the
OL,11,Fceremony.
